        // Intentional body/weapon-aura exceptions (audit `BODY_AURA_SKILLS`): the
        // official table marks the `twohand.str` layers with `head: true`, but they
        // are weapon/body glows and must stay at torso height instead of floating
        // above the head. `vertical: Body` keeps the official asset/duration/wav.
        (skill: 60, phase: Success, layers: [
            (kind: Str, anchor: Auto, attached_entity: true, head: false, vertical: Body, file: "twohand.str"),
        ]),
        (skill: 258, phase: Success, layers: [
